    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35443" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνεσία</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνίημι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>suggestion,</i> used only in 
				Ep.
			 form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐννεσίη</span></b> :
			dat. pl., with gen. pers., once in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κείνης ἐννεσίῃσι</span>
			<i>at</i> her <i>suggestion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.894
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ραίης, Διός, Ἥρης ἐνν.,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				494
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Cer.</u>
				30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Dian.</u>
				108
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπ᾽ ἐννεσίῃσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.7
				</span></i>
			, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				3.475
			</span></i>: gen. pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐννξσιάων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.1364
				</span></i>
			.</div>
